[Music]  welcome back this week scott atlas left  his position as white house coronavirus  advisor for years  dr atlas was a senior member of stanford  university's department of medicine  i know stanford well i taught there when  i first moved to america in 2012 and  i've always been grateful  for the opportunities it gave me but on  november the 20th the university's  faculty senate condemned  dr atlas they said his actions quote  contradict medical science they claim  he misrepresented knowledge and opinion  regarding the management of pandemics  showing disdain for established medical  knowledge and they alleged  that he violated stanford's core values  and high ethical standards  high ethical standards interesting  earlier in the year three current  members of stanford's medical faculty  epidemiologists john yanidis jay  batacharya and aaron bendavid published  a study  that completely upended what we thought  we knew about the virus  by testing antibodies in santa clara  county where stanford is based  the doctors established that coronavirus  was much more infectious  but much less deadly than we'd been told  this finding called into question the  entire strategy of our leaders  locking everyone down to try and stop  anyone being infected  if the virus was as infectious as the  stanford doctors showed  there's no point shutting down the  economy because that won't actually stop  the virus  and if it's much less deadly then for  most people it doesn't matter because  they'll have zero or mild symptoms  if they get infected the right policy  would be to protect the vulnerable  while letting everyone else get on with  their lives this was hugely significant  on this show we were the first to  criticize the lockdowns to say the cure  is worse than the disease  and we brought you the stanford doctor's  findings as soon as they're available dr  j bhattacharya joined us  on april the 12th what was the reaction  from stamford  this man lloyd miner is head of stanford  medicine  instead of supporting his colleagues  groundbreaking work he tried  to silence them using the pretext of a  manufactured whistleblower complaint he  ordered  an investigation for six months the  doctors  were threatened with retribution hounded  by stanford lawyers prevented from  speaking out  even subjected to smear campaigns in the  press  yet their pioneering findings have since  been confirmed  by multiple other studies this one  conducted in july and published in  september another more recently  from the cdc itself after six months the  doctors were completely exonerated  and able to speak freely again dr  bhattacharya became a founder  of the great barrington declaration  which argues against lockdowns and in  favor of what they call  focused protection for the vulnerable  it's been signed by over 12  000 medical and public health scientists  around the world  everything the stanford doctors said in  april was  true dr scott atlas shared their  analysis  and was a vocal advocate of the focused  protection approach  that's why the president hired him so  why did  stanford try to silence its own doctors  why did it smear dr atlas  because of this person dr sarah cody  santa clara county health officer she  ordered the nation's first  lockdown lockdown fanatics see her as a  hero  here's the queen of corona  misinformation msnbc's rachel maddow  dr cody and the other health officers in  the san francisco bay area acted faster  and more decisively  than anyone else in the country i didn't  know that  stay-at-home orders were within the  public health  toolkit how prepared were you how did  you all know to think about these things  as options good question  and here's the answer the lockdown plan  sarah cody ordered which then infected  so to speak the whole country  wasn't formulated in response to the  coronavirus it was an off-the-shelf plan  that she and some former colleagues had  prepared  after 9 11 as a response to a potential  bioterrorism attack  or a theoretical pandemic not on the  data or the science  of this pandemic still sarah cody  shot down santa clara county then the  bay area followed then the whole of  california  and then across the country we're  constantly told we have the best public  health system in the world  this week data was published showing  that the virus was circulating in  mid-december  2019. in late january this year  fauci was still telling us it was  nothing to worry about  the virus was here three months before  sarah cody's locked down  it was never going to contain it even at  the time the stanford antibody study  literally conducted  in sarah cody's county proved that  lockdowns were never going to contain it  yet preposterously given the data  sarah cody was still talking in june  this year  about quote full containment  what's all this got to do with stanford  and dr atlas  guess who sarah cody's husband is a  professor of medicine  at stanford and so they closed ranks to  protect their  own led by stanford medicine's boss  lloyd miner how dare anyone question the  lock down it was ordered  by the wife of our colleague this  is how the group thinks started the  stanford study  was the first scientific challenge to  the lockdown policy  so naturally it had to be destroyed the  dissenting doctors had to be attacked  smeared and silenced universities  science the whole point is to be open to  gather evidence to debate  stanford did the exact opposite they  attempted a cover-up it is grotesque  and a total disgrace meanwhile  the rest of us had to live with the  consequences the lockdown group think  spread from stanford to the medical  establishment to the media to the  bureaucrats and the democrats with  utterly cynical bad  faith and realizing the weakness of  their own position they accused  anyone against lockdown of wanting  people to die  but of course people died despite the  lockdown and thousands more died  because of the lockdown we brought you  the toll week after week  the establishment's cruel destructive  lockdowns failed  yet here we are again about to repeat  them  none of it's based on science or data  big  business open but small business clothes  25 this 50  that it is all capricious pseudo  scientific  nonsense look at biden with this  pathetic statement about masking in his  first hundred days it is pure bs  plucked out of thin air by some pr idiot  everything biden says about the virus is  for politics  not public health he has zero  credibility  lockdown leaders know their rules make  no sense  or they wouldn't break them all the time  every day  there's a new democrat lockdown  hypocrite  what moral authority do they have to  impose lockdowns on anyone  anywhere they're exploiting this virus  to micromanage our lives and we've had  enough of it  this lockdown group think is as wrong as  the establishment group thing  that gave us endless war in the middle  east the 50-year suck-up to china  but this is worse than both because the  costs are higher  lockdowns are the biggest public policy  mistake in history  and we have to fight them be responsible  protect the vulnerable live your life  help us fight back by following us at  steve hilton x and  next rev fnc and share this when we post  it

